Edit a nested feature directly. It is the only selected unit in a mixed Ruby and Node repository.
-- base/Gemfile --
source "https://rubygems.org"
gem "cucumber"
-- base/features/one.feature --
Feature: One
  Scenario: First
    Given one thing
-- base/features/nested/two.feature --
Feature: Two
  Scenario: Second
    Given one thing
-- base/features/one/steps.rb --
Given("one thing") {}
-- base/spec/one_spec.rb --
RSpec.describe("one") {}
-- base/web/package.json --
{"name":"web","devDependencies":{"vitest":"^1.0.0"}}
-- base/web/one.test.js --
test("one", () => {})
-- head/features/nested/two.feature --
Feature: Two
  Scenario: Second changed
    Given one thing
-- want --
scope graph
select features/nested/two.feature
noselect features/one.feature
noselect spec/one_spec.rb
noselect web/one.test.js
